{"id":5129,"date":"2024-12-06T15:59:17","date_gmt":"2024-12-06T07:59:17","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/?p=5129"},"modified":"2024-12-06T17:04:59","modified_gmt":"2024-12-06T09:04:59","slug":"air-slide-fabric-for-conveyor-system-of-powder","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/?p=5129","title":{"rendered":"Air Slide fabric for conveyor system of powder"},"content":{"rendered":"<figure id=\"attachment_5130\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5130\" style=\"width: 2292px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-5130 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/P-of-fabric-p1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2292\" height=\"1528\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/P-of-fabric-p1.jpg 2292w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/P-of-fabric-p1-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/P-of-fabric-p1-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/P-of-fabric-p1-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/P-of-fabric-p1-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/P-of-fabric-p1-2048x1365.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/P-of-fabric-p1-1320x880.jpg 1320w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/P-of-fabric-p1-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2292px) 100vw, 2292px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5130\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Air Slide Fabrics are solid woven fabrics and are used in air slides for pneumatic conveying of fine dry products like cements and other raw materials. As it\u00a0can be used in many fields and more than one year service life, we call it\u00a0\u201c<strong>model worker<\/strong>\u201c.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5132\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Air-slide-fabric-p2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"606\" height=\"299\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Air-slide-fabric-p2.png 606w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Air-slide-fabric-p2-300x148.png 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Air-slide-fabric-p2-600x296.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 606px) 100vw, 606px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Depending on the customer\u2018s request, we can offer air slide fabrics made of different raw materials, in various grades of air permeability and thickness.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Air slide fabric is mainly used for powder transportation, its application is mainly as following:<\/h3>\n<p><strong>Power\u00a0Stations<\/strong>\u00a0: Filtered Dust, Flue Ash, Discharging Flue Ash, Coal Dust;<br \/><strong>Building and Construction<\/strong>: Cement, Furnace Dust, Gypsum, Limestone, Finely Ground Quartz, Calcium Hydroxide, Lead Monoxide, Quicklime, Acid Crystals, Pure Clay, Phosphates, Magnesite Concentrate, Finely Ground Fluoride, Production of Aluminum;<br \/><strong>Chemical Industry<\/strong>: Thomas Meal (Fertilizer), Rubber Compounds, Sinter Dust, Catalysts Sodium Sulfate, Soap Powder;<br \/><strong>Silos \/ Tanks<\/strong>: Discharging Systems, Warehouse Units, Mixing Equipment, Homogenizing Systems;<br \/><strong>Chute Bottom<\/strong>s: Conveyor Systems, Ventilator Systems, Aeration Systems;<br \/><strong>Vehicles<\/strong> : Silo Truck Discharging Cones, Railway Wagon Discharging Cones, Vessel Aeration &amp; Discharging Bottoms, Container Aeration &amp; Discharging Bottoms.<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-28f84493 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-